Arabiyat Prestige Asha'AA Mauve EDP Perfume 110 ML - Fragsook : A Fruity Floral Scent with a Warm Musky Finish
Arabiyat Prestige Asha'AA Mauve EDP Perfume 110 ML starts with red berries and citrus accords, giving the fragrance a bright and lightly sweet opening. The berries add a juicy fruity touch, while citrus notes bring freshness and keep the opening lively and balanced.
The scent gradually moves into a floral heart featuring rose and white florals. Rose adds a soft romantic character, while the white floral notes create a clean and delicate impression. Together, they give the middle a smoother personality and connect the fruity opening with the warmer base.
During the dry-down, vanilla, amber, and white musk become more prominent. Vanilla contributes creamy sweetness, amber adds warmth, and white musk leaves a smooth, clean finish. These notes create a comfortable base while keeping the fragrance's floral character noticeable.
The overall composition blends fruity, citrus, floral, sweet, musky, and warm facets. Its development moves from fresh berries and citrus to delicate florals before settling into a softly sweet and warm base, making it an easy option for those who prefer balanced fruity-floral fragrances.
For everyday use, Arabiyat Prestige Asha'AA Mauve can suit casual outings, daytime plans, dates, gatherings, and relaxed evenings. The fresh opening keeps it approachable, while vanilla, amber, and musk add depth later.
At Fragsook, Arabiyat Prestige Asha'AA Mauve EDP Perfume 110 ML offers a fruity-floral profile that transitions naturally from red berries and citrus to rose and white florals, finishing with vanilla, amber, and white musk.

